      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Lumos Electrical supplied and installed a battery and hybrid inverter for my existing panel array in Bulli NSW. Everything is working perfectly. I have not imported any electricity from the grid since the install, which was on time, very professional, tidy. Software app for monitoring production, battery status and imports/exports to grid is excellent. They removed the old inverter, I assume for re-cycling, and installed a smoke alarm and bollard as per regulations.They connected the wiring so the battery will power selected lights and appliances in event of a blackout.I can highly recommend Lumos if you want a quality battery system at an excellent price.",
