    {
      "review_id": "130892",
      "reviewer_name": "Bernard",
      "reviewer_location": "NSW - 2526",
      "reviewer_state": "NSW",
      "reviewer_postcode": "2526",
      "reviewer_postcode_valid": true,
      "review_date": "2025-02-20",
      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "My initial contact was via phone to gain general knowledge of the overall Solar system we should install. Damien from Lumos Electrical Contracting gave me plenty of his time and I was very  impressed with his knowledge and common sense answers and approach to my queries. This was followed up by a site visit where he actually went onto the roof to confirm the space available for the panels which indicated more than could be assessed from Google maps. Neither of the previous two contractors went to this trouble.We installed 30 Aiko panels, a Sungrow 25kwh battery and a Sungrow 10kw inverter. I considered the quote very reasonable.The installation process went very well with a team of 5 initially that were all very polite and friendly as well as going about their work quietly, professionally and without fuss. They were all very particular about being tidy, didn't wear shoes in the house and cleaned up after they finished.I couldn't recommend Lumos highly enough. It was a real pleasure to have tradesman go about their work without any issues.",
