      "review_description": "Very happy with service from Lumos installing a new 13kw solar system on our new home. Damien took the time to meet on-site before providing a quote. This allowed us to troubleshoot with the builder the best way to install, as builder had already installed gyprock making things a little trickier. Damien provided a prompt quote and then his team were able to get the conduit installed promptly just before Christmas so we didn't hold up the builder....subsequently installed the full system in the New Year and very happy with the job and service provided. Would highly recommend.",
